{"id":"6afd6f15-0a20-83ec-9655-7113a69d5dab","sections":[{"count":6,"heading":"十一、章末綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目依難度排列，涵蓋氧化數、反應判斷、氧化還原能力及均衡。建議先自行作答，再查看解析。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 1 題 ｜觀念判斷</p><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Badge-v4RzAb\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">基礎</div></div>在 NH₄NO₃ 中，兩個氮原子的氧化數分別是多少？為什麼不能直接把氮的平均氧化數當成兩個氮各自的氧化數？<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起解析 </span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary);\">NH₄⁺ 中 N 為 −3；NO₃⁻ 中 N 為 +5。兩個 N 所處的化學環境不同，平均值 +1 不能代表個別原子的氧化數。</div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 2 題 ｜觀念判斷</p><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Badge-v4RzAb\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">基礎</div></div>判斷 2NO₂ + H₂O → HNO₂ + HNO₃ 是否為氧化還原反應，並指出氧化劑與還原劑。<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起解析 </span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary);\">是歧化反應。NO₂ 中 N 為 +4，HNO₂ 中為 +3，HNO₃ 中為 +5。NO₂ 同時是氧化劑與還原劑。</div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 3 題 ｜反應均衡</p><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Badge-v4RzAb\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">進階</div></div>以氧化數法均衡酸性條件下的 MnO₄⁻ + C₂O₄²⁻ → Mn²⁺ + CO₂。<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起解析 </span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary);\">2MnO₄⁻ + 5C₂O₄²⁻ + 16H⁺ → 2Mn²⁺ + 10CO₂ + 8H₂O。Mn 每個減少 5，兩個共減少 10；每個 C₂O₄²⁻ 的兩個 C 合計增加 2，五個共增加 10。</div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 4 題 ｜反應均衡</p><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Badge-v4RzAb\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">進階</div></div>以半反應法均衡鹼性條件下的 Cl₂ → Cl⁻ + ClO⁻，並說明反應類型。<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起解析 </span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary);\">Cl₂ + 2OH⁻ → Cl⁻ + ClO⁻ + H₂O。Cl 由 0 分別變為 −1 與 +1，因此是歧化反應。</div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 5 題 ｜綜合應用</p><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Badge-v4RzAb\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">挑戰</div></div>已知 Zn 能與 Cu²⁺ 反應，Fe 也能與 Cu²⁺ 反應，而 Zn 能與 Fe²⁺ 反應。比較 Zn、Fe、Cu 的還原能力，以及 Zn²⁺、Fe²⁺、Cu²⁺ 的氧化能力。<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起解析 </span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary);\">還原能力 Zn &gt; Fe &gt; Cu；對應的氧化能力 Cu²⁺ &gt; Fe²⁺ &gt; Zn²⁺。此比較依題目所給自發反應的相同條件成立。</div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 6 題 ｜綜合應用</p><div class=\"Badge-_iijmO Badge-v4RzAb\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-size=\"sm\" data-pill=\"\" data-variant=\"soft\" data-d-component=\"badge\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">挑戰</div></div>以半反應法均衡鹼性條件下的 MnO₄⁻ + SO₃²⁻ → MnO₂ + SO₄²⁻。<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\"><span>收起解析 </span><svg width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-d-component=\"icon\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 8a1 1 0 0 1 .707.293l7 7a1 1 0 0 1-1.414 1.414L12 10.414l-6.293 6.293a1 1 0 0 1-1.414-1.414l7-7A1 1 0 0 1 12 8Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary);\">2MnO₄⁻ + 3SO₃²⁻ + H₂O → 2MnO₂ + 3SO₄²⁻ + 2OH⁻。Mn 每個得 3e⁻，S 每個失 2e⁻，最小公倍數為 6。</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div>","messageId":"88ac7eb3-25f7-45c1-bf77-9b8b5e2d50d2","truncated":false}]}